    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "McGovern Estates are delighted to present 2 Burnaby Mill to the market, an exceptional five-bedroom detached family home, ideally positioned in a private cul-de-sac setting.\r\n\r\nOriginally built in 1996, this impressive property has been thoughtfully refurbished and redesigned to combine modern convenience with timeless, classic style. \r\n\r\nPresented in excellent condition throughout, this home has been enhanced by the exceptional attic conversion, plus 5th bedroom and spacious extension to the rear of the property creating additional versatile living space with stunning countryside views.\r\n\r\nCarefully considered alterations have transformed the property, creating a magnificent sense of space and light throughout what was already a generously proportioned family home.\r\n\r\nUpon entering, a welcoming entrance hall leads to a bright and spacious living room with dining room adjacent, while the heart of the home is undoubtedly the beautifully proportioned open-plan kitchen/living/dining room. A separate playroom/office conveniently positioned off the hallway completes this fine family home.\r\n\r\nThe bespoke Shaker-style kitchen is both elegant and highly functional, featuring a striking breakfast bar and polished quartz countertops. The generous dining area flows seamlessly into the snug living space with feature wood burning stove, creating an ideal environment for both everyday family life and entertaining.\r\n\r\nTo the rear, the west-facing garden provides a wonderful private outdoor space, with a combination of patio and lawn areas. Directly accessible from the open plan extension, it is perfectly suited to al fresco dining, relaxing and entertaining, particularly on long summer evenings, while remaining an inviting space to enjoy throughout the year.\r\n\r\nCombining generous accommodation, thoughtful contemporary upgrades and an enviable private setting, 2 Burnaby Mill offers a wonderful opportunity to acquire a beautifully presented family home designed for modern living.\r\n\r\nGreystones town is within easy reach where all your needs will be catered for with a wonderful selection of bistros, boutiques, restaurants and shops, the village library, churches and a large number of highly regarded schools. \r\n\r\nA host of sport and leisure clubs abound in the area including the Shoreline Leisure Centre sailing, rowing, football, rugby, tennis and GAA to name but a few as well as a great choice of renowned golf clubs, including Greystones, Powerscourt and Druids Glen.\r\n\r\nThe commuter will be delighted at the easy access to local bus stops and DART and rail transport services, both within walking distance. \r\n\r\nThe N11/M50 is also within easy reach making for an easy commute to the city, airport and beyond.\r\n\r\nACCOMMODATION\r\nEntrance Hallway\r\nSolid Oak wood flooring, decorative coving, radiator cover, carpeted stairs to landing, under stairs storage, WC off.\r\n\r\nLiving Room \r\nCarpeted flooring, decorative coving, open fire with solid wood mantle, cast Iron and tile inset, slate hearth, double doors to dining room, overlooking off street parking and amenity green.\r\n\r\nDining Room \r\nSolid Oak wood flooring, decorative coving, double doors to extended kitchen/ living/dining room.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Living Room \r\nCombination tile and solid oak wood flooring, fully fitted kitchen, floor and wall based storage cupboards, inset stainless steel sink unit, polished black Granite countertops, feature breakfast bar, ample countertops, integrated appliances, 3 x Velux window, feature gas stove and red brick wall, double glazed French doors to decking, bay window seat overlooking west facing rear garden and mountain views.\r\n\r\nOffice/Playroom\r\nCarpeted flooring, decorative coving, bespoke units, feature window seat overlooking off street parking.\r\n\r\nDownstairs WC \r\nTiled flooring, WC, pedestal wash hand basin with tile surround, extractor fan. \r\n\r\nUtility\r\nTiled flooring, plumbed and wired for washing machine and tumble dryer, extensive storage units, stainless steel sink unit, ample countertops, upgraded boiler, external door to side passage.\r\n\r\nLanding\r\nCarpeted flooring, double doors to large storage unit with shelving, hot press off landing, carpeted stairs to attic. \r\n\r\nBedroom 1\r\nCarpeted flooring, floor to ceiling built in wardrobe, overlooking front garden and amenity space, en-suite off.\r\n\r\nEnsuite\r\nFully tiled, WC, wash hand basin with storage under, mirrored cabinet with recessed lighting, fully tiled shower with mains power shower, chrome heated towel rail, recessed ceiling lights, external window.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\nCarpeted flooring, floor to ceinling built in wardrobe, overlooking westerly rear garden, GAA club, the Sugar Loaf and Downs Hill. \r\n\r\nBedroom 3\r\nCarpeted flooring, floor to ceiling built in wardrobe, overlooking front garden.\r\n\r\nBedroom 4\r\nCarpeted flooring, floor to ceiling built in wardrobe, west orientation overlooking countryside views.\r\n\r\nBedroom 5\r\nTongue and groove flooring, floor to ceiling built in wardrobe, shelving unit, overlooking front garden.\r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom\r\nTiled flooring, wood clad wall pannelling, feature roll top bath, WC, pedestal wash hand basin, fully tiled shower cubical with mains power shower, chrome heated towel rail, recessd lighting, 2x surround sound speakers, extractor fan, exterior window.\r\n\r\nConverted Attic\r\nCarpeted flooring, feature wood clad ceiling panels, recessed lighting,3 x Velux windows, additional eaves storage, bespoke storage and media unit, stunning views of the Sugarloaf Mountain, Downs Hill and Eir Og GAA pitch.\r\n\r\nOutside Front\r\nCobblelock driveway, mature plants and hedging.\r\n\r\nOutside Rear\r\nWest facing garden with spacious grass lawn, solid timber decking, raised red brick flower beds mature, stunning countryside views.\r\n\r\nSPECIAL FEATURES\r\nPrivate cul de sac setting\r\nEnviable B BER rating\r\nBeautifully decorated throughout\r\nSpacious Attic conversion with foam insulation\r\nImpressive open plan kitchen/dining/living room extension\r\nShaker style kitchen with bespoke cabinetry\r\nFeature gas burning stove\r\nProperty enjoys exceptional natural light enhanced by neutral decorative tones throughout\r\nDouble glazed windows and doors\r\nLarge west facing rear garden\r\nStunning views of Sugarloaf Mountain and beyond to the rear\r\nOverlooking amenity green\r\nGas fired central heating boiler installed 2019\r\nAmple off street parking\r\nOwner occupied\r\nHigh speed broadband\r\nFully alarmed\r\nWalking distance to the town of Greystones and the villages of Delgany\r\nLocal bus service near the property \r\nDART station within walking distance\r\nEasy access to N11/M50 for the commuter"
      },
